  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Libyan Customs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As EXBS looks to amplify its remote trainings in Libya, EXBS requires an implementer to oversee the repair and outfitting of the Libyan Customs College. This would encourage and enable Libyan Customs to host remote trainings.</narrative>
  </description>
